 class="text-brand-800 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg>With <!-- -->Manufacturing OS</div><p class="text-foreground/85 mt-1.5 text-sm">Production Planning checks material availability against the BOM &amp; Costing record and the capacity view before the work order is released to the shop floor schedule.</p></div></div></article><article class="border-border bg-card flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border shadow-sm"><h3 class="border-border border-b px-6 py-4 text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">A batch fails a QC parameter</h3><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-4 p-6"><div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] text-rose-700 uppercase"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>Today</div><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1.5 text-sm">The result goes into the QC register, but the batch has already moved to the FG store and is on a dispatch list.</p></div><div class="bg-brand-50 ring-brand-200 mt-auto rounded-xl p-4 ring-1"><div class="text-brand-800 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg>With <!-- -->Manufacturing OS</div><p class="text-foreground/85 mt-1.5 text-sm">Quality Control logs the non-conformance on the batch, Inventory &amp; FG holds it from dispatch, and Shop Floor records the rework against the same work order.</p></div></div></article><article class="border-border bg-card flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border shadow-sm"><h3 class="border-border border-b px-6 py-4 text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">A customer asks which RM lot went in</h3><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-4 p-6"><div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] text-rose-700 uppercase"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>Today</div><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1.5 text-sm">Someone digs through issue slips, production sheets and QC files for a day to piece together one batch&#x27;s history.</p></div><div class="bg-brand-50 ring-brand-200 mt-auto rounded-xl p-4 ring-1"><div class="text-brand-800 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg>With <!-- -->Manufacturing OS</div><p class="text-foreground/85 mt-1.5 text-sm">Batch traceability in Inventory &amp; FG shows the RM lots, operations and QC results behind the FG batch, and the COA comes from Quality Control.</p></div></div></article></div></div></section><section class="relative isolate py-16 sm:py-24 lg:py-28"><div class="container-default"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center"><div class="mb-4 flex justify-center"><span class="chip-brand inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-foreground"></span>Connects with</span></div><h2 class="text-balance text-3xl font-semibold sm:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] lg:leading-[1.08]">Fits into the way your business already runs.</h2><p class="mt-4 text-pretty text-base text-muted-foreground sm:text-lg">Manufacturing OS shares its record with the rest of Extraaaz and hands off cleanly to the tools you keep.</p></div><div class="mt-12 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><div class="border-border bg-card flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border p-5"><span class="bg-foreground text-brand-500 flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-line