xt-sm">RM receipt, FG put-away and pick for dispatch run on the same stock as production.</p></div></div><div class="border-border bg-card flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border p-5"><span class="bg-foreground text-brand-500 flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plug h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22v-5"></path><path d="M15 8V2"></path><path d="M17 8a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v4a4 4 0 0 1-4 4h-4a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V9a1 1 0 0 1 1-1z"></path><path d="M9 8V2"></path></svg></span><div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight">Finance with GST-ready billing</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm">Business Operations Finance picks up consumption and FG costs and raises GST-ready invoices.</p></div></div><div class="border-border bg-card flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border p-5"><span class="bg-foreground text-brand-500 flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plug h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22v-5"></path><path d="M15 8V2"></path><path d="M17 8a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v4a4 4 0 0 1-4 4h-4a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V9a1 1 0 0 1 1-1z"></path><path d="M9 8V2"></path></svg></span><div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight">Logistics OS for outbound</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm">Finished goods move into transport planning and POD without retyping the dispatch.</p></div></div><div class="border-border bg-card flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border p-5"><span class="bg-foreground text-brand-500 flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 2