or" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>QC registers</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>A WMS that does not know a work order</li></ul><a class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full transition focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:size-[1.05em] [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-brand-600 text-foreground font-semibold shadow-[0_10px_30px_-8px_rgb(248_208_0_/_0.7)] hover:bg-brand-400 hover:shadow-[0_18px_45px_-10px_rgb(248_208_0_/_0.85)] hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-0 h-12 px-6 text-base mt-6 w-full" href="/contact/?product=manufacturing-os#demo">Book a demo<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></aside></div></div></section><section class="relative isolate py-16 sm:py-24 lg:py-28 bg-muted/40"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10" style="background:radial-gradient(ellipse 55% 45% at 85% 100%, rgb(17 17 17 / 0.05), transparent 70%)"></div><div class="container-default"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center"><div class="mb-4 flex justify-center"><span class="chip-brand inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-foreground"></span>Why teams switch</span></div><h2 class="text-balance text-3xl font-semibold sm:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] lg:leading-[1.08]">The work is already happening. It is just happening in the wrong places.</h2><p class="mt-4 text-pretty text-base text-muted-foreground sm:text-lg">If this list feels familiar, the product is for you. If it does not, skip it — we would rather you not buy the wrong OS.</p></div><div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 sm:p-8"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-rose-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-triangle-alert h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg>Before Extraaaz</div><ul class="mt-6 grid gap-5"><li><h3 class="text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">The BOM lives in someone’s laptop</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Engineering has a version, stores has another, costing has a third. A change on the floor never makes it back.</p></li><li><h3 class="text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">Planning is a weekly meeting</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Work orders are issued on paper. Material shortage is discovered after the machine is set.</p></li><li><h3 class="text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">Shop floor capture is delayed</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Operators fill a sheet at the end of the shift. Downtime and rejects are negotiated, not recorded.</p></li><li><h3 class="text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">QC is a stamp, not a record</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Parameters, sampling and non-conformance live in registers. Traceability is a search through files.</p></li></ul></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-brand-200 bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-50/80 to-card p-6 sm:p-8"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>After <!-- -->Manufacturing OS<!-- --> is live</div><ul class="mt-6 grid gap-5"><li><h3 class="text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">One BOM, one cost, one routing</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">What you plan to make is what stores issue and what costing uses.</p></li><li><h3 class="text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">Work orders with material and capacity</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">You do not start a job the stores cannot feed or the line cannot absorb.</p></li><li><h3 class="text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">Live shop floor and QC on the batch</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Output, downtime, reject and COA sit on the same batch as RM and FG stock.</p></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="relative isolate py-16 sm:py-24 lg:py-28"><div class="container-default"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center"><div class="mb-4 flex justify-center"><span class="chip-brand inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-foreground"></span>Fit</span></div><h2 class="text-balance text-3xl font-semibold sm:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] lg:leading-[1.08]">Who this product is for — and who it is not.</h2></div><div class="mt-12 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 shadow-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-map-pin h-5 w-5 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg><h3 class="mt-3 text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">Discrete / engineering</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Multi-level BOM, routing, and operation-wise capture.</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 shadow-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-map-pin h-5 w-5 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg><h3 class="mt-3 text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">Process &amp; batch</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Batch traceability, QC parameters, yield.</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 shadow-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-map-pin h-5 w-5 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg><h3 class="mt-3 text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">Textile &amp; apparel</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Style, process stages, and FG that sales can actually promise.</p></div><div class="ro