d sessions. No six-month classroom. The system should feel like their job, not a new one.</p></li><li class="relative rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5"><span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-brand-700">Step <!-- -->04</span><h3 class="mt-2 text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">Go live, then expand</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Start with one site or one workflow. Add modules, locations and users once the first loop is trusted.</p></li></ol></div></section><section class="relative isolate py-16 sm:py-24 lg:py-28"><div class="container-default"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center"><div class="mb-4 flex justify-center"><span class="chip-brand inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-foreground"></span>Plans</span></div><h2 class="text-balance text-3xl font-semibold sm:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] lg:leading-[1.08]">Priced for how you actually run — not a fake public rate card.</h2><p class="mt-4 text-pretty text-base text-muted-foreground sm:text-lg">Starter, Growth and Enterprise are packaged around locations, modules and support. Exact commercials come after we see your volume. No invented rupee figures on this page.</p></div><div class="mt-12 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-3"><div class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border p-6 border-border bg-card"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Starter</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Single location getting off spreadsheets.</p><ul class="mt-5 grid flex-1 gap-2.5"><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Core Manufacturing OS modul